{"title":"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/d/77d73aaab4cb99f25530f64d2a4f52f9d1f46fb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(x)  =  -\\frac{5}{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"105\" height=\"38\" /> and  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />  is  in  the  third  quadrant,  what  is  the  absolute  value  of  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/a/1aaac9dd19564d770191f619cf02267664c27bfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos(\\frac{x}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"51\" height=\"33\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/2342962cc6ba11060c06751c71b9d86381c38052.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\,\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\quad\\mathrm{(B)}\\,\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\quad\\mathrm{(C)}\\,\\frac{6}{13}\\quad\\mathrm{(D)}\\,\\frac{5}{13}\\quad\\mathrm{(E)}\\,-\\frac{5}{13} \\\\ \\quad\\mathrm{(F)}\\,\\frac{\\sqrt{26}}{26}\\quad\\mathrm{(G)}\\,-\\frac{\\sqrt{26}}{26}\\quad\\mathrm{(H)}\\,\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\quad\\mathrm{(I)}\\,\\text{none of the above}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"418\" height=\"83\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is in the third quadrant, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/3/c938e3f9dea789595c6290070f7975f45bc4300a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" /> is negative, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/2/9027ff5bdd3b8e2492ab1640468a1a8cf4c7aa59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos(x) = -\\sqrt{1 - \\tfrac{25}{169}} = -\\tfrac{12}{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"214\" height=\"32\" />.  Using the half-angle identity (or the double angle cosine identity),\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/f/01f0aa3302711b081f5fa46ee95bed8f5c7c42c8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} |\\cos(\\frac{x}{2})| &amp;= |\\sqrt{\\frac{\\cos(x) + 1}{2}}| \\\\ &amp;= \\sqrt{\\frac12 \\cdot \\frac{1}{13}} \\\\ &amp;= \\sqrt{\\frac1{26}} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{\\sqrt{26}}{26} \\end{align*}\" width=\"198\" height=\"190\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/a/14a835cd444fe5f7f4ecf1254ef257779de00343.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(F)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"38\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest\" title=\"2006 iTest\">2006 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?ti